vnsnowkey (1.0.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Always reset typing buffer on Enter/Tab/Esc/Insert and browser autocomplete navigation even when reset_on_navigation_keys=false.
  * Prevent per-app hotkey/tray toggles from leaking EN to config.toml or unseen apps, sync langToggleEpoch against focus races, and preserve live language across IM/charset switches.
  * Cancel pending mod-only hotkeys (Ctrl+Alt) on mouse wheel scroll or extra mouse buttons, resync held modifiers on SYN_DROPPED, and restrict caption password detection to system/unclassed dialogs.

 -- VNSnowKey Contributors <vnsnowkey@localhost>  Fri, 20 Nov 2026 20:10:00 +0700

vnsnowkey (1.0.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix CapsLock case synchronization across ASCII pass-through and Vietnamese diffs (preventing CHÀo / chÀO).
  * Fix mid-typing Vietnamese loss from browser tab caption false-positives, per-app state leaks, X11 MappingNotify XKB resets, and multi-keyboard modifier disconnects.

 -- VNSnowKey Contributors <vnsnowkey@localhost>  Fri, 20 Nov 2026 18:40:00 +0700

vnsnowkey (1.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix X11 reboot & GNOME/KDE XKB overlay application, add live keymap verification and safe fallback.
  * Add multi-distro clean uninstaller script.
  * Unlock spellcheck-locked words cleanly on Backspace and allow mid-word oă syllables.

